# UI library

This project uses **shadcn/ui** (Radix Nova) + **Tailwind CSS v4** + **Lucide**.

- Build UI from `src/components/ui/*` primitives first.
- Import with `@/components/ui/...` and icons from `lucide-react`.
- Need a missing primitive? Run `npx shadcn@latest add <name>` — do not hand-roll a parallel button/input/card system.
- Style with Tailwind utilities and existing theme tokens in `src/index.css`.
- Do **not** add MUI, Chakra, Ant Design, Bootstrap, or other UI kits.

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD
import { Button } from '@/components/ui/button'
import { Card, CardContent } from '@/components/ui/card'
import { HeartPulse } from 'lucide-react'

// ❌ BAD
import Button from '@mui/material/Button'
```
